    "accordions": {
      "[01]What is the typical lead time for bulk commercial orders?": "<div class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground font-default text-base border-t border-border/50 mt-2 pt-4\">Our standard turnaround for B2B orders is 3-5 business days. For high-volume industrial runs or complex custom signage, we provide a specific timeline during the quoting process to ensure your deadlines are met with precision.</div>",
      "[02]Do you have a minimum order quantity (MOQ) for laser services?": "<div class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground font-default text-base border-t border-border/50 mt-2 pt-4\">While we specialize in commercial volume, we don't enforce a strict MOQ for all items. However, our pricing is optimized for bulk production. For industrial tags and corporate gifts, orders typically start at 25 units to remain cost-effective.</div>",
      "[03]Do you offer shipping across Quebec and Canada?": "<div class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground font-default text-base border-t border-border/50 mt-2 pt-4\">Yes, we ship daily across Quebec and the rest of Canada. We use reliable commercial carriers to ensure your branded products, hospitality items, or industrial labels arrive safely and on schedule at your facility or event venue.</div>",
      "[04]What file formats do you require for engraving and cutting?": "<div class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground font-default text-base border-t border-border/50 mt-2 pt-4\">For maximum precision, we prefer vector files such as .AI, .EPS, .SVG, or .DXF. If you only have high-resolution raster files (.PNG, .JPG), our design team can often convert them for a small technical preparation fee.</div>",
      "[05]Can you engrave on materials provided by the client?": "<div class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-muted-foreground font-default text-base border-t border-border/50 mt-2 pt-4\">Absolutely. We frequently work with client-supplied materials, from restaurant glassware to industrial metal plates. We perform a material compatibility test to ensure our 80W CO₂ laser delivers the high-contrast, permanent finish you expect.</div>"
    },
